<title>TUNISIA: Tunisia welcomes Clinton's re-election.</title>
<headline>Tunisia welcomes Clinton's re-election.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisian President Zine al-Abidine Ben Ali on Wednesday congratulated U.S. President Bill Clinton on his election victory.</p>
<p>In a message to Clinton, Ben Ali said Tunisia would continue its cooperation with Washington in efforts towards peace in the Middle East.</p>
</text>
